     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorSchedulingLogic</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorSchedulingLogic\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorSchedulingLogic\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCHED-01\"> </a></b>Create scheduling logic tables</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create scheduling logic tables following the DMN standard for service reminders and follow-up visits.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCHED-02\"> </a></b>Define schedule parameters</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define scheduling logic in spreadsheet format with appropriate timing, conditions, and service specifications.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCHED-03\"> </a></b>Link to business process activities</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can link scheduling logic to corresponding activities in business process workflows.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\